    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <tags>tls certificate x509 ssl ocsp pkcs12 mcp cli mtls</tags>
    <summary>TLS certificate analysis, format conversion, and key verification (CLI + MCP server).</summary>
    <description>
dcert decodes, validates, and converts TLS certificates and runs as an MCP
(Model Context Protocol) server for AI assistants. It analyzes HTTPS/mTLS
endpoints, exports PEM chains, checks expiry and OCSP revocation, and converts
between PEM/DER/PKCS12 formats.

This package installs `dcert.exe` (CLI) and `dcert-mcp.exe` (MCP server) and
adds them to your PATH via Chocolatey shims.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/SCGIS-Wales/dcert/releases/tag/v__VERSION__</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
